# ── Content indexes are RUNTIME ASSETS, not optional build artifacts ─────────
# `content/_index.json` is read by frontend/lib/pyq-bank.ts and by the quiz
# engine; `frontend/public/data/content/manifest.json` is served directly from
# public/ and hashed by the content ledger. They were untracked by f6419cf on
# the assumption that `npm run content:build` regenerates them — it does not
# (build.ts only emits syllabus-notes). Removing them caused ENOENT test
# failures, a broken `ledger:check` and 404s on the deployed site, so they are
# tracked again. The separate `content/_index.json` under public/ stays retired:
# 7bb51358 deliberately moved paid bodies off the public CDN.


# One-off lab-block generation helpers (tmp-*) — never commit these.
frontend/scripts/tmp-*
